    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "The CWS™ (diaphragm load cell based) is an automatic catchweigher designed to weigh containers statically with no operator intervention. The instrument comprises digital load cells, an interface unit and a control and display unit. The instrument captures the container weight automatically once the container has been lifted and reached a stable position. The system is designed for permanent installation on various types of container handlers; the load cells and electronics are permanently installed on the spreader. Load values are transmitted to a display unit (typically installed in the operator's cab) via an interface unit, and the final data is transmitted to the Terminal Operating System (TOS). Devices: semi-automatic zero-setting (≤ 4% Max) via user interface or TOS, long term storage device, display and storage of individual and total weights. Access to legally relevant parameters is password-protected; a non-editable Config Version counter increments on every change of a legally relevant parameter."
